# call with one argument in a callable's code runs that Structure over itself (plan M11 5b; R20: the one-argument call
# is general, with no case of its own for a method's data): Point of the callable's data counts its own n.
fn: f () int (
    Point: (int: n 0; n := n + 1)
)
    call: Point
    call: Point
    return: Point\n
end: f
int: seen f()
